<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT--OrthoLogic Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT--OrthoLogic Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Rob Faulkner on Thursday changed his earnings estimates for OrthoLogic Corp following the announced purchase of the Continuous Passive Motion unit of Danninger Medical Technology Inc.</p>
<p>--said the acquisition will be dillutive to fiscal 1997 earnings and accretive to 1998 earnings.</p>
<p>--cut fiscal 1997 earnings estimates to $0.12 a share untaxed from $0.14 a share and raised fiscal 1998 earnings estimates to $0.30 a share untaxed from $0.29 a share.</p>
<p>--said the company was fairly valued for a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>--shares of OrthoLogic were unchanged at 5-3/8 in midday trading on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
